NOTE ON THE DATA

This licence covers the CODE in this repository only.

The contents of data/ are option chains retrieved from Yahoo Finance via the
yfinance library. They are redistributed here for research reproducibility and
remain subject to Yahoo's own terms of use. This licence grants no rights over
them, and no warranty is made as to their accuracy. See research/RESULTS_11-20.md
for measured defects in the source data, including an implied volatility field
that violates put-call parity by more than three volatility points.
